    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d652">

                <pb facs="0622" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.156/261</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-06T11:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 6, 1917, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The time for filing claims by Ports Company expired last Monday. This week
                    President and commission have devoted to matter and have offered settlements by
                    which Cuban Government pays for bonds at par and turns over assets of company to
                    stockholders. Understand London interests being consulted by cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
